Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, watch as we pass by,\Nas we raise our flag, up high in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go now, sailing through the\Nendless ocean, facing all that comes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for our treasure. Nobody has\Never got to witness with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep believing in our\Ndreams, And let our heart lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once we got all the\Nothers left is to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When we face the dark and stormy weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the pace, we'll\Nlink our hearts together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Start raising our flag as we journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our chances are close to\Nnone, We won't back down from anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start off the chase!\NLet's start off the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Toward our own dreams,\Nwhile keeping the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,With a compass pointing to our goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop till we've\Ngone around the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never stop,\Ntill we're at the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that we'll ever quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.80,0:01:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep heading for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.34,0:01:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase!\NLet's start up the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your eyes\Nwhat we'll have to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.46,0:01:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories we'll say in our hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Brand new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I must admit, I underestimated you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.06,0:01:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined you could have made\Nit this far and by yourself no less!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says I'm by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't have made it\Nhere without my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and even if I could I wouldn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But you wouldn't understand that because\Nall you people think about it yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.12,0:02:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon my whole crew will be here\Nand we'll put an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And stop doing stupid stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.84,0:02:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean stupid stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rude, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:02:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs are too slippery for me to stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This power of yours sure is creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Say whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, brag all you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll just make my\Nvictory that much sweeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.98,0:03:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid deer gorilla going nuts. I'll\Ndeal with him when this mess is over! I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Still got to get the key\Nfrom that secretary lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey wait you dumb monster\Nstop stealing my thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's crush him, Oimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me, Kashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.34,0:04:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus your attack on one\Ngiant at a time, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him at Kashi's feet! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now charge and bring him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like bad news out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.26,0:04:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Those giants have been holding back\Nthe Marine Forces for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're wearing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry it up, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.94,0:05:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.85,0:05:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought a pirate\Nwould make it so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This has turned into a real disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cape, this is your chief speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Nmorons doing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I got one of the straw\Nhats right on my heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You answer when I speak to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't press that button, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is the Golden Transponder Snail!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Silver Transponder Snail has received\Na signal. It's an emergency. A Buster Call
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,has been requested under the authority of\NAdmiral Aokiji. What's the location in his
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.14,0:06:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,lobby contact the five\Nvice admirals closest
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to that location all things considered it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,may be faster to reach\Nthere from headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How long? There is no\Nmore than 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,sir in that case prepare 10 battleships\Nfor departure and inform the vice-admirals
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,of the situation make it quick yes sir a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Buster Call has been\Nrequested the destination
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.82,0:06:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,is Enies Lobby repair 10 battleships for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,sale immediately hello\Nhello what is it chief
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,oh now i get through this is the one i was
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.48,0:06:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to use Not that it matters anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I push the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all things, it is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Triggered the Buster Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say Buster Call? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he supposed to be talking to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to cancel it right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.08,0:07:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's Robin's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cancel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't boss me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they broadcasting this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.98,0:07:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Don't move!\NI can't! I'm tied up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.64,0:07:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what's wrong with\Nthe Buster Call anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Chief Spandam\Ntalking. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for me\Nto get worked up over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Making that call was well within my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the chief of Cypherpole\Nnumber nine, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.24,0:08:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To ensure that your transfer goes over\Nsmoothly, I requested a Buster Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a thing wrong\Nwith that. Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,if it's a little overkill\Nbetter safe than sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a small price to\Npay to make sure those
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.64,0:08:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,pirates get eliminated\Nyou're a fool i told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Before that won't be\Nthe end of it this is an
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,attack without mercy\Nwithout humanity i know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the chief talking\Nbut i don't recognize the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,woman's voice the buster\Ncobble burn everything on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The people, the buildings,\Neven the island itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It will sacrifice anything\Nand everything in its path!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The nightmare won't end\Nuntil nothing remains!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power you're invoking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.26,0:09:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had any idea what happened in Ohara\Nyears ago, you would not be doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The government is well aware\Nof the sacrifices involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how important this mission is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Cutty Flam burned the blueprints to\NPluton, we can't afford to make a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the last hope we have\Nof reviving the ancient weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking about a military power\Nthat can turn this whole era upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we have to sacrifice\Na few thousand soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it's better than letting you\Nslip out of our hands again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the consequences,\NI just don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think of it as murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sacrifice to protect the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.62,0:09:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of protecting the future, my\Npromotion is depending on this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:09:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we vote on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.40,0:10:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he mean by sacrifices?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they gonna kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Human lives are at stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to remind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,CP9 can kill in the name of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, if we think 100 deaths\Nare needed to save 1,000 lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,then we will kill those 100 people\Nimmediately, without question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,For true justice, you must\Nbe merciless at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,if those idiot soldiers\Ncouldn't even stop a few
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,pirates from invading a\Ngovernment base of this size,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,they're better off dead anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the line is still connected\Non your transponder snail. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you gotta be freakin' kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone heard all of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, this is a\Nstrong movie. Speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would we believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone get off the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A Buster Call has been\Ninvoked on Andy's lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't get away from\Nhere immediately, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't tell them things\Nthey don't need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.46,0:11:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what should we do now? I can't say\NI'm happy, but there's nothing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah I should have seen it\Ncoming with that idiot in charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're in some sort of\Ntrouble the one in trouble here is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You poor miserable things all of your\Nhopes completely shattered I wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,worry too much when it comes down to the\Nwire like this we always pull together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:12:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor pirate boy, you must have been born\Nunder a bad sign to have look like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But on the other hand, you probably\Nlike it this way, don't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get hit with the buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Battleships are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.96,0:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from Enies Lobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that battleships are coming,\Nbut why are the marines running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She said the island was going\Nto be burned to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they burn down their own island?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you're going to\Nrun, at least untie us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.18,0:12:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Buster Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If you stay here, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring as many ships as you\Ncan and get ready to set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The battleships could be here any second!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess they left us behind. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.98,0:12:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get us out of here, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.52,0:12:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been dangerous ever since\Nwe set foot on this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What about our big bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen to Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we're leaving without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll wait as long as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are coming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, are you saying we should\Njust sit here and get blown up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.32,0:13:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to screw around anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's finish them off quick and get\Nto the Gates of Justice while we still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just saw to something. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a way to get the handcuffs\Noff without any blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.06,0:13:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe a way to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.24,0:13:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As a sword, you will be known\Nas the Great Blade Nose Storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's kind of awesome,\Nbut now's not the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,WHERE ARE YOU?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you keep\Nyour damn mouth shut?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the whole island's in a panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.32,0:14:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What if those pirates get away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize they're gonna\Nblame me for that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If that was Robin talking,\Nthen where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.08,0:14:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right behind these doors, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As you seem to have surmised,\Nyou'll have to go through me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way. I'm not gonna let\Nyou keep me from Robin any longer
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,say what you like This is the\Nend you'll never see her again
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems we finally reached the climax
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.18,0:15:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If I stay here, I could die as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna run, then\Nleave the key here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You must forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, I fear the game must end now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.52,0:16:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very least, please\Naccept this parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same thing she did to Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.72,0:16:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't pick up the climate act.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:17:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this mess. What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit this look doesn't exactly\Ndo wonders for your curves,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but your skin is quite nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Although there is one catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your already pathetic\Nstrength has been cut in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd give up on the key if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.20,0:17:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. You wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop wasting my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I call it mirage tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over here, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't toy with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all fakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She turned into a monster? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have Devil Fruit\Npowers as well, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What a ditz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.18,0:19:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.60,0:19:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Buster Call!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The battleships are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't get moving, they're\Ngonna burn us to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have so-and-such\Ndouble-root powers, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you dense?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, that's not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But this isn't some random monster, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are reindeer antlers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.74,0:20:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd recognize that cat anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.82,0:20:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that giant thing really, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I'd never see a beast like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Boo-Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.39,0:20:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.31,0:20:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, it's you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:20:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:20:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.76,0:21:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he just doesn't recognize me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I must look strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Chopper, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was kidding. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you actually\Nturned into that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't treat me like I'm a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.10,0:21:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She ignored me so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.92,0:21:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, what's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.30,0:21:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Nami! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.86,0:22:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.77,0:22:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanchi's down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where that awful thing\Nwandered in from, but I'll make it pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.58,0:22:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you lay a finger on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.28,0:22:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you hurt my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.16,0:22:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.50,0:22:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to find a way to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing is your friend? How amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You pirates keep strange\Ncompany, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.92,0:22:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She ignored me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.28,0:23:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude can you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.32,0:23:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to have you take\Ncare of that monster for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.54,0:23:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've been given an\Norder to eliminate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.66,0:23:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And time is running short.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.48,0:23:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.90,0:23:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.81,0:23:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can dodge, but\Nmy legs are slippery like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.21,0:23:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my legs is back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.92,0:23:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I miss something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.82,0:23:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have happened when\NChopper threw the bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.00,0:23:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is wash\Nthe soap off with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.44,0:23:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.84,0:23:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you can counter the\Neffects Of my golden bubbles with
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.32,0:24:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,water That doesn't mean I'm going\Nto stand by And let you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.08,0:24:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheep cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.00,0:24:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Relaxing bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.94,0:24:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.92,0:24:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing a little wind can't fix!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, side blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.48,0:24:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.58,0:24:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.80,0:24:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My strength is...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.82,0:24:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Supple finger pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.52,0:24:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My tag whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.92,0:24:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That was helpful. Helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.56,0:24:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you blow me away with\Nan attack like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.94,0:24:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,then those annoying bubbles of yours\Nget blown away too, aren't you tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.38,0:25:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you like, I'll blow you\Naway until there's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.96,0:25:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The forecast is cloudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.40,0:25:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This sure beats that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.92,0:25:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,magic show stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.83,0:25:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing used to do clouds\Nfighting with lightning again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.52,0:25:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,These clouds aren't\Nfor lightning. They're?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.34,0:25:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Way too thin for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.84,0:25:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I have something else in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.20,0:25:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.42,0:25:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.96,0:25:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The forecast is rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.12,0:25:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pool ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.58,0:25:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pour down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.12,0:25:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain temple!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.66,0:25:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I work so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.72,0:25:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude to wash everything away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.34,0:26:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If your idea of nice is getting\Nmy ass beat, then I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.98,0:26:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Full charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.04,0:26:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirage tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.20,0:26:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.56,0:26:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've watched your every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.60,0:26:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know your strengths.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.16,0:26:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know all your weaknesses as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.96,0:26:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.34,0:26:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirage Tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.34,0:26:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight Morgana!
